  "label": "Atomic bombings of Hiroshima and Nagasaki",
  "description": "Historical events in which the United States dropped atomic bombs on the Japanese cities of Hiroshima and Nagasaki in August 1945, resulting in massive destruction and loss of life. These bombings were pivotal in ending World War II but also caused long-term suffering, radiation sickness, and social trauma for survivors (hibakusha) and their descendants. The meme trivializes this genocide-level event by comparing it to a 'friend'.",
